  "notes": "Implemented plain-SYCL helper-library dequantization in ggml/src/ggml-sycl/dequantize.{hpp,cpp}. Covered F32, F16, Q4_0, Q4_1, Q5_0, Q5_1, Q8_0, Q2_K, Q3_K, Q4_K, Q5_K, and Q6_K to fp32/fp16. IQ*, MXFP4, NVFP4, BF16 output, and non-contiguous dispatch remain residual. Selftest passes bit-exact against ggml/src/ggml-quants.c and CUDA q8_1 semantics. Existing GET_ROWS/CPY backend tests cover similar quant types, but they do not yet prove this helper library is exercised because getrows.cpp duplicates the relevant inline dequant code and cpy.cpp does not consume it.",
